{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-11-01 22:03:00', 'title': 'KYNDRYL HOLDINGS SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400; NETSCOUT SYSTEMS TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KYNDRYL HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE:KD) WILL REPLACE NETSCOUT SYSTEMS INC. (NASD:NTCT) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400, AND NETSCOUT SYSTEMS WILL REPLACE INVACARE CORP. (NYSE:IVC) IN THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 5. S&P 500 AND 100 CONSTITUENT INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CO. (NYSE: IBM) IS SPINNING OFF KYNDRYL HOLDINGS IN A TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON NOVEMBER 4.'}